# Read by oxfmt. Generated content trees are regenerated by the engines on every
# build and must not be reformatted (oxfmt would strip the codegen's blank lines
# and fight the generator on each build). oxlint already skips them via their
# `/* oxlint-disable */` banner.
.hyper-down/
.hyper-json/
dist/

# Google Search Console verification file — its content must stay byte-exact
# (Google reads it verbatim); oxfmt parses it as HTML and rejects the format.
public/google*.html
